<title>POLAND: Jutrzenka Q1 net rises to PLN 4.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Jutrzenka Q1 net rises to PLN 4.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jutrzenka preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 6.69 vs	5.33</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   6.28 vs	4.99</p>
<p>    net profit				 4.33 vs	3.31</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Jutrzenka SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 36.79 vs     30.08</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  26.61 vs     21.62</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.95 vs	1.68</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.07 vs	0.07</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.47 vs	0.41</p>
<p>    investment				 2.28 vs	2.55</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
